{
  "name": "ZIP Preprocessing Pipeline",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Preprocessing Pipeline\n1. Form POSTs multipart to this webhook\n2. ZIP is uploaded to Garage or a ZIP-URL is passed through\n3. Preprocessing API is called\n4. Status is polled every 30s\n5. Email sent on success/failure\n\n## Credentials setup (required)\nImporting this workflow is not enough — every Header Auth field below is left unassigned on purpose and must be created and linked in the n8n UI before this workflow will run:\n- Webhook node -> use the shared \"Webhook API Key\" credential (the same one across every Flow form). This is the only key you ever hand to your users.\n- POST/GET nodes -> use a \"Preprocessing Service API Key\" credential, whose value must match the API_KEY set in service-trocr-preprocess's own .env file. You need to know that value yourself; never share it with users.",
        "height": 468,
        "width": 436
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        13552,
        2544
      ],
      "id": "e326db67-6077-42bb-a80a-aaf93f6af993",
      "name": "Sticky Note"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "preprocess",
        "authentication": "headerAuth",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {
          "ignoreBots": true
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        13888,
        3824
      ],
      "id": "eff864ee-446b-4ef3-9755-2fa935db9e41",
